#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`\"Level-2A\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid ""
"Matched loosely — `\"L2A\"`, `\"Level-2A\"`, `\"S2MSI2A\"`, pygeofetch's own"
