#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`check_nodata_margins`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid ""
"Heuristic: flag scenes where the AOI sits mostly in the scene's edge margin."
" Off by default to avoid false positives on legitimately edge-adjacent AOIs "
